    55	  "W4.2":
    56	    "its fails_if ends \"with no written reason\", which no tool can see (research-q/compare.md, Where they agree)",
    57	  "W5.1":
    58	    "check: git; reviewer — whether a commit embodies a new decision, or a session writes what it learned, is " +
