    60	  "W6.1b": "two agent sessions writing one journal file is not visible in git history (design-decisions.md 6)",
    61	  "W6.2": "an edit lost without a conflict cannot be shown by git (design-decisions.md 6)",
    62	  "K1.1":
    63	    "check: git; reviewer — whether a commit changed the behaviour an entry governs needs that entry read " +
