Key changes per finding: `indextool.ts` records `crashed`/`unmapped`/`measured`/`compared` with recognisers built from `project-memory/INDEX.md`; `checks.ts` maps unreached and unmapped clauses to "could not run" and clears K4.1 to "needs a reviewer"; `gitchecks.ts` reads presence from the staged state, adds the staged diff for deletions/renames, compares merge parents for dropped entries, and records every failed git call; `gitrequirements.ts` rewrites K4.3 over every version transition with a per-transition `changed:` line; `entry.ts` unquotes scalars and skips fenced blocks; `cachechecks.ts` reads Rd1 per clause with an `unresolved` verdict; `warn.ts` builds lines from id + category + file name; `cli.ts` re-runs unless the cache variable is already `"0"`.

